### GET User Profile (Protected) /auth/me
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### POST Logout Profile /auth/logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### DELETE Delete Profile /auth/me
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### PATCH Update Profile /auth/me
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Fred",
  "last_name": "Dupont",
  "first_name": "Jean"
}